                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Arisitariko, ooli mu siboe nase, aamurumiire enywe kimileembe, ne Mariko, wandaye owa Baranaba yesi. (Mwaboolelwe khale mwakaanile Mariko aaba ne echa ebweeneyo.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua, lundi olaangwa Yusito, yesi aamurumiire enywe kimileembe. Bataru bano bong'ene nibo Bayaudi basuubili bakholanga nase kimilimo khulwe bubwami bwa Wele, mala babeele be buyeeti bukali po khwise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
