              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumalile khusoma ebarwa yino, lola muli yasomeelwe mu kanisa eya Laotikia. Ne siise sisienesio, musome ebarwa niyo bawandaayefwe mu Laotikia balamurumira enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
